        "created_at": "2017-07-27T21:59:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Setting up for a solo spirit game of Guard the Heart (first scenario I've ever done)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Am working with Keeper of the Wilds again, decided to pull a lv 0 England for stage 2, and set-up looks to be interesting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Quick Question though, actually starting the game is delayed due to dinner prep and I can track the game if people are interested in seeing what happens, it says that spirits start with 2 additional powers \"One from each deck\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'm 90% sure, but does that mean I start the game with a minor and a major power? I understand it is draw and keep the top card, but that still seems like a huge boon to start the game with</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:49:49.038Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 4,
