        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Setting up for a solo spirit game of Guard the Heart (first scenario I&#39;ve ever done)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Am working with Keeper of the Wilds again, decided to pull a lv 0 England for stage 2, and set-up looks to be interesting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Quick Question though, actually starting the game is delayed due to dinner prep and I can track the game if people are interested in seeing what happens, it says that spirits start with 2 additional powers &quot;One from each deck&quot;.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I&#39;m 90% sure, but does that mean I start the game with a minor and a major power? I understand it is draw and keep the top card, but that still seems like a huge boon to start the game with</p>",
